, Sally? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She's really superstitious. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If I move too early, I'm going to have to pay rent  at a new apartment.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's true. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure what to do.", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "image": "engenn5le18ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, if you move to Boston, I'll be the first person to visit! I love it here!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why don't you apply for work there,V? Are you going back to San Francisco?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If I go back to San Fran, I'll have to see Marco again! I'm not sure I'm ready for that.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, you have time to think about it. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I had time!! I can't make up my mind \u2026", "id": 3, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn5le18ob09re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}